  "steps": [
    "Cook the noodles: boil noodles in salted water until cooked. Drain completely and pat dry.",
    "Crisp the noodles: spread noodles, spray lightly with oil, toss and air fry at 180°C for 8–10 minutes until crisp.",
    "Prepare tofu: crumble tofu, add salt, pepper and cornflour. Toss well, spray lightly with oil and air fry at 180°C for 10–12 minutes until crisp.",
    "Sauté vegetables: in a pan, add sesame seeds and all chopped veggies. Sauté on high flame for 2–3 minutes (keep crunchy).",
    "Prepare sauce: mix Schezwan chutney, soy sauce and ketchup.",
